  "extra_setup": "Two Sparks linked over CX7 RoCEv2 (10.0.22.1/.2). Shared ed25519 key head->worker; worker mounts head HF cache via SSHFS at /mnt/head-hf-cache (user_allow_other in /etc/fuse.conf) and binds it to /root/.cache/huggingface. Image is pulled on head, tagged local/sglang-inkling:gb10-kvquant, docker save/load to worker. Download thinkingmachines/Inkling-Small-NVFP4 and RadixArk/Inkling-Small-DSpark-Preview into ~/.cache/huggingface on head.",
  "notes": "Worker (rank 1) started first, head (rank 0) serves API. ${CONTAINER_MODEL}/${CONTAINER_DRAFT} are absolute snapshot paths under /root/.cache/huggingface (fallback: HF repo ids). ${NODE_RANK} 0 head / 1 worker; ${CX7_IF}/${CX7_IB} head enp1s0f1np1/rocep1s0f1, worker enp1s0f0np0/rocep1s0f0. HF_HUB_OFFLINE/TRANSFORMERS_OFFLINE only set when both snapshots are local. Image ENTRYPOINT is 'true' so --entrypoint python3 is required. Page size must be 1; KV fp4_mx_block16 needs triton attention. Script header says port 30000 but default SGLANG_PORT is 8888. NODES=1 (TP=1, single Spark, drop --nnodes/--node-rank/--dist-init-addr) is documented only for testing and OOMs at concurrency. Runtime derived from drowzeys/keys-1M-CTX-Inkling-Small-NVFP4-Dspark... repo. KV cache 1,142,712 tokens at mem 0.85. README says wrapper scripts MIT but repo has no LICENSE file.",
